{"ts": 1791256327.12605, "type": "step", "step": 9, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.27998147170370613, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8630104796182297, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.3048197132422881, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791256329.3220549, "type": "step", "step": 10, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. For the evaluation section, you want to say what success metric you used and why it matches the build.\n\nUse this framing:\n- **pass@k** = at least one of k attempts succeeds.\n- **pass^k** = all k attempts succeed.\n- For a build that needs a reliable agent/system, **pass^k is the stronger measure** because it tests consistency, not just occasional success.\n- If you only report a proxy metric, say so and explain the limitation. Example: quiz score is a proxy; longer-term retention or correct performance later is closer to the real goal.\n\nIf you want, paste your current evaluation paragraph and I\u2019ll help rewrite it into something submission-ready.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.27998147170370613, "pass_k": 0.3847194656129005}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8630104796182297, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.3048197132422881, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
