{"ts": 1791256340.881336, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Next step: tighten the **environment definition** and then do a quick sanity check on the whole writeup.\n\nUse this structure:\n- **State:** the information the agent tracks (e.g. files, calendar)\n- **Observations:** what the agent can perceive from the environment\n- **Actions:** what the agent can do (e.g. open, send)\n\nA clean sentence you can use is:\n\n*I defined the environment as a simple file-and-calendar workspace. The state includes files and calendar events; the agent observes file contents, notes, and messages; and the available actions are opening files and sending messages.*\n\nThen the build eval should say:\n- **pass^k over 3 seeds**\n- all 3 runs must succeed\n- this measures reliability/consistency\n\nIf you want, I can help you turn your current bullets into a polished final paragraph right now.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\n[activity] t=11 messages 4m", "t": 15, "activity": [{"t": 11, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.27998147170370613, "pass_k": 0.5952628489582595}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8630104796182297, "motivation": 0.7330753570864191, "reliance": 0.38481971324228814, "persistence": 0.4593844359280642, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": []}}
